/** A colour of the workspace as {r, g, b, a} (a is 0 for `transparent`, else 1): `#rgb`, `#rrggbb`, `rgb(r, g, b)` or a CSS name (also after a `#`, as PlantUML reads it). Anything else is null: it is ignored, never written into the page. */
